name=Quick Crafting
id=QuickCrafting
poster=poster.png
description=Scales down how long crafting takes.
description=<BR>
description=Hand crafting recipes run at a percentage of their normal duration, so a
description=40 second recipe becomes 4 seconds at the default 10%. Recipes keep their
description=relative cost instead of all collapsing to the same length.
description=<BR>
description=Configurable in the Sandbox options. Nothing else in the game is affected.
author=igork
